               WRONG: "Soong et al., 2013"
               WRONG: "Exome sequencing... Am J Hum Genet. 2013;92(3):422-430"
               Use "NR" if not found in Bibliography.
      * family_count: How many families from this source (use null if not specified)
      * context: Quote from main text explaining which families came from this source
    - Use empty array [] when: all families are NEW to this paper, OR no families reported
  * citations: array of box_id citations where this disease entity is described, each with telegraphic commentary (a few words, e.g. "family counts", "Case III: de novo p.Ser181Cys")
